@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
participant "未滿兩歲兒童\n育兒津貼資訊系統" as Baby #DDEBF7
participant "托育服務\n資訊整合系統" as Daycare #E2F0D9

Baby -> Daycare : 1 傳送每日正在領取育兒津貼的資格資料
alt 傳送成功
  Daycare --> Baby : 2 取得傳送成功訊息
else 傳送失敗
  Daycare --> Baby : 3 取得傳送失敗訊息
end
@enduml
